          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 126526,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare i confronti per verificare se una stringa è uguale o diversa da un'altra stringa.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Equality operator",
            "id": 126527,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se una stringa è uguale a un'altra stringa, possiamo usare l'<strong>operatore di uguaglianza</strong>, <code>==</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "True",
            "id": 126528,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se la stringa a sinistra è uguale alla stringa a destra, come in <code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code>, il risultato è <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"apple\"</code>, seguito da <code>==</code> e infine <code>\"apple\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "False",
            "id": 126529,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se la stringa a sinistra non è uguale alla stringa a destra, come in <code>\"apple\" == \"orange\"</code>, il risultato è <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>==</code>, seguito da <code>\"orange\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Comparing the same string",
            "id": 126530,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche confrontare tra loro le variabili che memorizzano stringhe, come in <code>fruit1 == fruit2</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fruit1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fruit2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(fruit1 == fruit2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"fruit3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>fruit1</code>, seguito da <code>==</code> e infine <code>fruit2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
