            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza una stringa in <code>item2</code> per fare in modo che il risultato del confronto sia <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pipe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isDuplicate = item1 == item2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(isDuplicate)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"pipe\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
