            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se una stringa non è uguale a un'altra stringa, usiamo l'<strong>operatore di disuguaglianza</strong>, <code>!=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>"
